# qnc_v4 timeline freeze

`qnc-app/src/qnc_timeline.rs` is frozen by default.

Do not edit it unless the user explicitly says "odmrznuti qnc-timeline" or
otherwise gives direct permission to change timeline code.

The timeline is a passive UI projection/control surface. It must not become the
owner of playback truth, media decode, source timing, filmstrip generation,
project state, workflow state, or form-specific logic.

Allowed without unfreeze:

- read-only audit
- running tests
- documentation that does not change code behavior

